# Old VitePress URLs (https://nino.xgamedev.net/{lang}/doc/{page}) -> v4 docs.
# Anchors (#...) are kept by the browser. Pages whose old anchor moved to its
# own page in v4 (advanced) are listed in the docs' anchor redirects instead.
